"""Polygon fillers with 0x4864-byte stack frames hold six per-scanline dword arrays of 768
entries (esp+k*0xc00) plus locals from 0x4800. Remap them to `rows` entries.
SITES lists (vaddr of the displacement field, original displacement) for the three filler
functions of the stock NFS.EXE; regen() rebuilds it with capstone (development only)."""
import struct
FUNCS=[(0x90b30,0x91360),(0x91360,0x91b90),(0xb5b50,0xb6380)]
def remap(d,rows):
    if d>=0x4800: return d+6*(rows-768)*4
    k,r=divmod(d,0xc00); assert r<0x40,hex(d); return k*rows*4+r
